abstract: >-
  A Universal Structural Theory of Language, semantics, symbol and phoneme,
  sustained by a mathematical operator of indetermination (I = 0/0).
  The Universal Translation Engine 0/0 is a mathematical-linguistic system
  capable of reconstructing universal translations through multilingual
  phonetic segmentation, symbolic projections, archetypal comparisons,
  phonemic analysis, proto-linguistic reconstruction, Harappan modeling,
  universal dictionary, and scientific numerology.
