title: "Universal Translation 0/0 - Motor de Tradução Universal"
abstract: >-
  A cross-linguistic analysis system for reconstructing Harappan phonemes
  through comparative phonetic analysis across Tamil, Chinese, Norse, Latin,
  Tupi, and other language families. Creates a modern Rosetta Stone for the
  Indus Valley script.
